OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMany areas are starting dry
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud,
OL,7,Falthough showers already affecting
OL,8,Fwestern areas will become more
OL,9,Fwidespread. These showers will be
OL,10,Flocally heavy, with the odd rumble of
OL,11,Fthunder. It will become drier from the
OL,12,Fwest later.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA few showers across the
OL,15,Fnorth and west will merge overnight to
OL,16,Fgive some longer spells of rain.
OL,17,FElsewhere, it will become largely dry
OL,18,Fwith clear spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
