OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FDry and settled across much
OL,6,Fof England and Wales, with variable
OL,7,Famounts of cloud. Cloudier elsewhere,
OL,8,Fwith a band of rain affecting
OL,9,FScotland, which will sink southwards
OL,10,Fduring the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
